Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 11:04:23 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 076/260] [ae-patch] Fix the review findings on rail docking:
 count push panels and the workspace gap

An open files or logs push panel takes width from the chat's row but was left
out of the dock decision, so the rail could dock and leave the chat well under
480 px; the workspace panel's 8 px gap was missing too. Both now count. The
decision re-renders the rail only when a resize flips it, the 304 px width
lives in one constant, and the resize test restores jsdom's own innerWidth.
